  // groups get suffixed ids (deadly_ranged, hasty_accessory, quick_accessory); Brisk is brisk_accessory because the
  // old invented 'brisk' id is an alias of quick (data/config/aliases.json). Accessory valueMultiplier is Terraria's
  // value step (squared like the weapon multiplier).
